title: Courts and Prisoners
subtitle: Justice: an amnesty, jury courts and legal advice for workers.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
card-image: img/polish/polish_gov_justice.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && PolishProjects.cardAvailable(Q, 'justice_policy') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.justice_policy (technical reference 17.11–17.12; card catalogue 8.13). Opening and closing the card are free;
// a confirmed option costs this month's action. Z — 1.00 (the sketch and the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026): three permanent
// options; the democratic guarantees stay in the constitutional debate, the review of a named abuse left the card.
PolishProjects.cardView(Q, 'justice_policy');
// Z — 0.66 (decision 2A): the ministry of this card, on its page and as a badge in the hand.
Q.pl_gc_ministry = PolishProjects.ministryLine(Q, 'polish_gov_justice');
!}

= Courts and prisoners

*[+ pl_gc_ministry +]*

The courts judge by the different laws of the former partitions, and workers’ and minority activists sit in the prisons. Democracy stands at [+ pl_gc_democracy +] of 100.

[+ pl_gc_budget +]

[? if pl_gc_projects : [+ pl_gc_projects +] ?]

- @amnesty
- @jury
- @legal_aid
- @court_savings
- @nothing
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@amnesty
title: Declare an amnesty for political prisoners
subtitle: No cost to the budget; once in the chapter. The workers trust PPS more (+3), but squad members leave the prisons too, and political violence rises (+3). [? if pl_justice_policy_amnesty_coalition : [+ pl_justice_policy_amnesty_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'justice_policy', 'amnesty').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_justice_policy_amnesty_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'justice_policy', 'amnesty');
!}
go-to: result

@jury
title: Introduce jury courts in political and press cases
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget unit. Democracy grows stronger (+2). [? if pl_justice_policy_jury_coalition : [+ pl_justice_policy_jury_coalition +] ?]
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'justice_policy', 'jury').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_justice_policy_jury_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'justice_policy', 'jury');
!}
go-to: result

@legal_aid
title: Open free legal advice for workers
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget unit. The trade unions trust PPS more (+5).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'justice_policy', 'legal_aid').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_justice_policy_legal_aid_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'justice_policy', 'legal_aid');
!}
go-to: result

@court_savings
title: Make savings in the courts
subtitle: The budget gains 1 unit at once. Trials drag on, and democracy weakens a little (−1).
choose-if: {! return PolishProjects.optionStatus(Q, 'justice_policy', 'court_savings').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_justice_policy_court_savings_why +]
on-arrival: {!
// Z — 1.11 (decisions 5A and 2A of 8 XI 2026): the saving of this ministry, +1 B with its political cost.
PolishProjects.chooseOption(Q, 'justice_policy', 'court_savings');
!}
go-to: result

@nothing
title: Do nothing now
subtitle: The card is played and comes back in three months.
on-arrival: {!
PolishRules.skipCard(Q);
!}
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= Courts and prisoners

[+ pl_gc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
